WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:06.570
Speaker 1: a former Newsmax host and right
wing shock jock, as they're calling him by

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:11.320
the name of Dick Ferrell, died of covid.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:19.010
Now, Ferrell had spent a lot of time during
the pandemic trashing Dr. Fauci, calling the

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.970
entire pandemic a scam.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.109
DIMMICK and essentially trying to downplay
everything, downplay the effectiveness of

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:30.579
the vaccines, casting doubt on those, casting
doubt on the pandemic itself, saying, oh,

00:00:30.579 --> 00:00:38.920
this is Democrats trying to control things
dies last week from covid, but before he died.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:42.480
He had one of those come to Jesus moments
that we have seen far too often in the people

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:47.210
who die from the fact excuse me, die from
the virus.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:50.300
He texted his friends.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.390
Telling them, go get the vaccine.

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:58.489
So here was somebody who had devoted more
than a year.

00:00:58.489 --> 00:01:00.900
Of his media career.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:06.100
To try to convince people that this wasn't
real, that this wasn't a big deal, that it

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.740
was all a scam.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:12.240
And the last thing he did on this earth.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:15.950
Was tell his closest friends it's real.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.530
Protect yourselves, get the vaccine.

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:23.929
Now he's dead.

00:01:23.929 --> 00:01:30.719
We also had the story last week of Scott Apley
from Texas, Republican official on a county

00:01:30.719 --> 00:01:33.640
board from Texas.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:38.420
He died of covid, he died of covid five days.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:43.619
After posting anti vax material on Facebook.

00:01:43.619 --> 00:01:47.340
Left behind a young, I believe, infant son.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.350
Left behind a wife.

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:52.529
Dead from covid.

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:55.049
These stories.

00:01:55.049 --> 00:02:01.289
Of people dying from covid after spending
a year and a half pretending it didn't exist

00:02:01.289 --> 00:02:02.969
are becoming far too common.

00:02:02.969 --> 00:02:06.869
We are now at the point we're getting at least
one per day.

00:02:06.869 --> 00:02:11.330
And a lot of them all in the same way before
the person dies, they're tweeting out, they're

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:14.170
texting out there, doing whatever they can,
they're calling the loved ones and saying,

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.330
please get the vaccine.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:22.580
I can't believe I didn't do this, I was too
stupid, some of them have said.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:26.250
And that really is what we're looking at here,
folks.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:32.330
I'm willing to bet I would never have agreed
with anything Dick Farrell ever said, ever

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:36.630
in his political career.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:40.140
And I still wish that that man were alive
today.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:44.420
Same thing with Mr. Scott Apley, same thing
with all of these people that are dying because

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:50.530
they didn't want to do the one thing that
probably would have saved their lives.

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:54.460
Every death is a tragedy, doesn't matter if
it's on the right or on the left, if it's

00:02:54.460 --> 00:03:02.920
an anti Voxer or if it's a you know, whoever
every death is a tragedy.

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:08.630
And it's unnecessary at this point to stories
like this are hard stories like this are getting

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:11.160
very, very hard to report on.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:15.820
But I do want to continue to do this because
hopefully they get through to some people.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:21.220
Hopefully this acts as the wake up call when
you hear these stories of people gasping in

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:27.430
their final breaths saying, I wish I'd gotten
the vaccine, asking their doctors, can I still

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:28.980
get it?

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:35.710
And the doctor having to tearfully tell them,
I'm sorry, but it's too late.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:40.730
That's the country we're living in now, and
that's a country that has been consumed with

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:42.820
misinformation.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.280
I'm Fern Cousins in for David Pakman, we'll
be right back.

